讨的岁月中，就在帮助母亲照顾和保护孙策，分担后方劳务，后在曲阿嫁给弘咨。","tc":"孫堅長女，孫策、孫權之姊，孫堅在擔任縣長期間與吳旖所生。與孫靈月為孿生姐妹。靈陽智略過人，在早期孫堅四處征討的歲月中，就在幫助母親照顧和保護孫策，分擔后方勞務，后在曲阿嫁給弘咨。","en":"The eldest daughter of Sun Jian and elder sister of Sun Ce and Sun Quan, born to Wu Yi during Sun Jian's tenure as a county magistrate. She and Sun Lingyue were twin sisters. Lingyang possessed exceptional intellect, during the early years of Sun Jian's campaigns, she helped her mother care for and protect Sun Ce, sharing the burden of labor in the rear. She later married Hong Zi in Qua.","jp":"孫堅の長女で、孫策・孫権の姉。孫堅が県長を務めていた頃に呉旖との間に生まれた。孫霊月とは双子の姉妹にあたる。霊陽は知力に優れ、孫堅が各地を転戦していた初期の頃より、母を助けて孫策の世話や保護にあたり、後方の労務を分担していた。後に曲阿で弘咨に嫁いだ。","kr":"손견의 장녀이자 손책과 손권의 누이로, 손견이 현장을 지내던 시절 오의와의 사이에서 태어났다. 손령월과는 쌍둥이 자매이다. 령양은 지략이 뛰어나 손견이 각지를 정벌하던 초기 시절부터 어머니를 도와 손책을 보살피고 보호하며 후방의 일을 분담했다. 훗날 곡아에서 홍자에게 시집갔다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ11003","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"灵阳","nameTc":"靈陽","nameEn":"Lingyang","nameJp":"霊陽","nameKr":"령양","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"孙灵阳","power":"WJ10038","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1047","gender":"1","rule":"72","force":"54","wise":"81","politics":"75","charm":"89","will":"72","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"14/14/14/14/14/80/55/14","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1004205;1000602","debateCard":"1003302;1005002","warSoul":"S1000605","battleSoul":"1001102","debateSoul":"1006005","warSoulPoint":"5200","battleSoulPoint":"2900","debateSoulPoint":"6600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000505","p